111
00:06:18,086 --> 00:06:21,631
Oh, you know what that is? That is a train whistle.

112
00:06:21,798 --> 00:06:23,466
Like I'm the conductor.

113
00:06:24,092 --> 00:06:27,220
But I'm sort of the conductor of the office here. Right?

114
