132
00:07:24,653 --> 00:07:26,237
Mr. Poop? Schrute.

133
00:07:26,655 --> 00:07:29,199
Mr. Schrute. Sure, Mr. Poop.

134
00:07:32,619 --> 00:07:33,828
Schrute.

135
