139
00:07:54,391 --> 00:07:56,351
You ever been there? No.

140
00:07:56,643 --> 00:08:00,397
You've never been to Jitterz? Ryan, you are so dorky.

141
00:08:00,855 --> 00:08:03,233
Give me your number so I can text you.

142
00:08:06,444 --> 00:08:07,654
Come on.

143
00:08:08,196 --> 00:08:09,572
