145
00:08:12,283 --> 00:08:14,577
I think something a little fishy is going on.

146
00:08:14,661 --> 00:08:16,287
- A little fishy? - Yeah.

147
00:08:16,371 --> 00:08:19,666
I mean, I've been noticing them all day, and I just think...

148
00:08:19,916 --> 00:08:21,543
That little girl is a child!

149
00:08:21,626 --> 00:08:25,005
I don't wanna see you sniffing around her anymore this afternoon.

150
00:08:25,088 --> 00:08:26,168
Do you understand? Yes, sir.

151
00:08:26,214 --> 00:08:27,507
Boy, have you lost your mind? No.

152
00:08:27,590 --> 00:08:29,590
'Cause I'll help you find it. What you looking for?

153
00:08:29,634 --> 00:08:30,945
Ain't nobody gonna help you out there.

154
00:08:30,969 --> 00:08:32,154
Jesus can come through that door

155
00:08:32,178 --> 00:08:33,239
and he's not gonna help you

156
00:08:33,263 --> 00:08:35,223
if you don't stop sniffing after my child. Okay.

157
00:08:35,473 --> 00:08:37,267
Stanley yelled at me today.

158
00:08:37,851 --> 00:08:41,146
That was one of the most frightening experiences of my life.

159
00:08:52,949 --> 00:08:55,827
That was <i>Greensleeves,</i> a traditional English ballad

160
00:08:55,910 --> 00:08:57,829
