161
00:08:57,912 --> 00:09:00,331
And now, a very special treat.

162
00:09:00,415 --> 00:09:03,376
A book my <i>grom-mutter</i> used to read me when I was a kid.

163
00:09:03,460 --> 00:09:07,547
This is a very special story. It's called <i>Struwwelpeterl</i>

164
00:09:07,797 --> 00:09:11,342
